From 15a09e1da7d0d512e9aa930cd14483354e078b5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mat Kowalski <mko@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 15:50:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/26] Add kube-vip static pod manifests for BGP VIP
 management

Add kube-vip-api bootstrap manifest and MachineConfig templates for
both API and ingress VIP management using kube-vip. The API manifest
is included in the bootstrap path when BGP VIP management is enabled.
The ingress variant is placed in disabled-manifests for later
activation by CNO.

- manifests/on-prem/0010-kube-vip-api.yaml: bootstrap static pod
- templates/common/on-prem/files/0010-kube-vip-api.yaml: MC template
- templates/common/on-prem/files/0020-kube-vip-ingress.yaml: MC template
- templates/arbiter/00-arbiter/on-prem/files/: empty overrides
- getPlatformManifests(): include kube-vip-api in BGP branch
- bootstrap_test.go: verify kube-vip-api presence expectations
---
 manifests/on-prem/0010-kube-vip-api.yaml      |  53 +++++++
 pkg/operator/bootstrap.go                     |   1 +
 pkg/operator/bootstrap_test.go                | 140 ++++++++++--------
 .../on-prem/files/0010-kube-vip-api.yaml      |   0
